  "item_short_desc": "<p>Inspired by a tried-and-true military classic, our Vintage M-65 Field Jacket provides long-lasting comfort while braving the great outdoors. The field coat features a full-length front zipper with a snap-up storm flap and a concealed stowaway drawstring hood for additional protection from the elements.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "10763",
  "description": "<p>Inspired by a tried-and-true military classic, our Vintage M-65 Field Jacket provides long-lasting comfort while braving the great outdoors. The field coat features a full-length front zipper with a snap-up storm flap and a concealed stowaway drawstring hood for additional protection from the elements. Vintage Fit &amp; Feel: Crafted from soft washed cotton fabric, this breathable outdoor jacket provides a battle-worn appearance from the start. The drawstring waist, adjustable bottom, and hook &amp; loop wrist cuffs allow you to find the perfect fit. Storage Pockets: The vintage jacket comes equipped with 4 large button-down flap pockets for storing gear and everyday carry essentials. Utility at the Forefront: These all-season jackets feature button-down shoulder epaulettes for a vintage military style for casual wear. The all-season coat comes with 2 hook &amp; loop chest tabs for military name tape and a removable Rothco patch on 1 of them. Action Ready: From outdoor adventures to everyday wear, the vintage field jacket transitions seamlessly though the spring, summer, fall, and winter seasons, ideal for traveling, camping, hiking, and more.</p>",
